{"path":"outputs/review_replies/thread_2.md","content":"⚠️ IMPORTANT fixed in this PR — you were right that the "remaining direct `notifyListeners()` sites are synchronous setters" claim was inaccurate for `reconfigure()`: its notify at `agent_service.dart:2312` runs after `await waitForIdle()`, i.e. inside the abort-drain reach.

