3. `reconfigure(...)` unawaited — it aborts the run and suspends inside `waitForIdle()`;
4. `service.dispose()` lands inside that drain;
5. `await switchOver` — pre-patch this failed deterministically with **"A AgentService was used after being disposed" at `agent_service.dart:2312` in `AgentService.reconfigure`** (reproduced on the unpatched tree before applying the fix); post-patch green.

Scope note: the remaining direct `notifyListeners()` call sites in the class body were re-audited one by one — all now synchronous setter paths with no intervening `await` (`setApprovalMode`, `setSkillsAccess`, `setToolEnabled`, the send-path early-returns, and the relay `reconfigure` override whose tail notify follows a non-awaited `dispatch`). The part-file extension members already route through `_notify()`. No other post-await notify remains in `AgentService`.

